  "body": "There's something undeniably special about Olde Torbay. The quiet streets, welcoming community, stunning beaches and breathtaking views create a lifestyle that's hard to find and even harder to leave.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Torbay's most sought after pockets, this beautifully refreshed home captures it all. Elevated to soak in sweeping Hauraki Gulf views, it's a place where every day feels just that little bit more special. Wander to Waiake Beach, Long Bay or Winstones Cove, grab a coffee from the village or simply relax at home and enjoy the outlook.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is light, inviting and designed for effortless family living. Offering three generous bedrooms, including a master with ensuite, a well appointed family bathroom and two separate living areas, there's space for everyone to come together or enjoy their own retreat.\r\n\r\nStep outside and discover a private backyard where children can play, pets can roam and entertaining comes naturally. It's a home that feels relaxed, welcoming and ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a beautiful home. It's an opportunity to become part of one of the North Shore's most treasured coastal communities and enjoy the lifestyle so many aspire to.",
